{"id":"08-verification","number":8,"slug":"verification-closing-the-loop","title":"Close the loop: let agents check their work","short":"Close the loop","module":"Working with one agent","summary":"Ask people who ship with agents for their single best tip and you hear the same thing: give the agent a way to check its own work. Tests, types, a running app, a browser. Without a check, “looks done” is the only signal, and you become the bottleneck.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Ask people who ship real software with agents for their single best tip, and a surprising number give you the same answer. This lesson is that answer.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 8","module":"Module 2 · Working with one agent","title":"Close the loop: let agents *check their work*","subtitle":"The habit that makes agents trustworthy.","bubble":"Let me run that again.","mood":"work"},"start":0.5,"dur":10.447,"words":[{"text":"Ask","s":0.8,"e":1.12},{"text":"people","s":1.2,"e":1.44},{"text":"who","s":1.52,"e":1.6},{"text":"ship","s":1.68,"e":1.92},{"text":"real","s":2,"e":2.24},{"text":"software","s":2.32,"e":2.8},{"text":"with","s":2.88,"e":2.96},{"text":"agents","s":3.12,"e":3.44},{"text":"for","s":3.52,"e":3.6},{"text":"their","s":3.72,"e":3.84},{"text":"single","s":3.92,"e":4.16},{"text":"best","s":4.32,"e":4.56},{"text":"tip,","s":4.72,"e":5.12},{"text":"and","s":5.2,"e":5.28},{"text":"a","s":5.32,"e":5.36},{"text":"surprising","s":5.48,"e":6},{"text":"number","s":6.08,"e":6.32},{"text":"give","s":6.4,"e":6.56},{"text":"you","s":6.6,"e":6.64},{"text":"the","s":6.72,"e":6.88},{"text":"same","s":7,"e":7.12},{"text":"answer.","s":7.2,"e":8.16},{"text":"This","s":8.24,"e":8.4},{"text":"lesson","s":8.48,"e":8.96},{"text":"is","s":9.04,"e":9.2},{"text":"that","s":9.28,"e":9.36},{"text":"answer.","s":9.44,"e":10.08}]},{"template":"quote","chapter":"The big secret","narration":"Peter Steinberger, creator of OpenClaw, calls it the big secret. To be effec