rthand is: use red green TDD. Write a test, watch it fail, that's red. Then write just enough code to make it pass, that's green. Every good model understands those few words.","params":{"title":"~/shop · red/green TDD","lines":[{"k":"you","text":"add a 10% discount for orders over $100. use red/green TDD","at":"red green"},{"k":"tool","text":"Edit(src/discount.test.ts)  + 'applies 10% over $100'","at":"Write a test"},{"k":"tool","text":"Bash(npm test discount)"},{"k":"err","text":"FAIL  applies 10% over $100  (expected 108, got 120)","at":"watch it fail"},{"k":"tool","text":"Edit(src/discount.ts)","at":"just enough"},{"k":"tool","text":"Bash(npm test)"},{"k":"ok","text":"PASS  48 tests  (0.4s)","at":"green"}]},"start":84.834,"dur":18.426,"words":[{"text":"The","s":85.134,"e":85.294},{"text":"strongest","s":85.494,"e":85.774},{"text":"pattern","s":85.854,"e":86.254},{"text":"is","s":86.334,"e":86.494},{"text":"test","s":86.574,"e":86.894},{"text":"first.","s":86.974,"e":87.694},{"text":"Simon","s":88.014,"e":88.334},{"text":"Willison's","s":88.414,"e":88.894},{"text":"shorthand","s":88.934,"e":89.374},{"text":"is:","s":89.534,"e":89.774},{"text":"use","s":90.174,"e":90.414},{"text":"red","s":90.494,"e":90.734},{"text":"green","s":90.894,"e":91.214},{"text":"TDD.","s":91.374,"e":92.014},{"text":"Write","s":92.574,"e":92.734},{"text":"a","s":92.774,"e":92.814},{"text":"test,","s":92.894,"e":93.614},{"text":"watch","s":93.734,"e":93.854},{"text":"it","s":93.934,"e":94.014},{"text":"fail,","s":94.094,"e":94.734},{"text":"that's","s":94.814,"e":94.974},{"text":"red.","s":95.054,"e":95.374},{"text":"Then","s":95.934,"e":96.174},{"text":"write","s":96.254,"e":96.494},{"text":"just","s":96.574,"e":96.814},{"text":"enough","s":96.854,"e":97.054},{"text":"code","s":97.134,"e":97.294},{"text":"to","s":97.374,"e":97.454},{"text":"make","s":97.534,"e":97.614},{"text":"it","s":97.654,"e":97.694},{"text":"pass,","s":97.774,"e":98.494},{"text":"that's","s":98.574,"e":98.734},{"text":"green.","s":98.814,"e":99.454},{"text":"Every","s":99.774,"e":100.014},{"text":"good","s":100.094,"e":100.254},{"text":"model","s":100.334,"e":100.654},{"text":"understands","s":100.734,"e":101.294},{"text":"those","s":101.374,"e":101.614},{"text":"few","s":101.694,"e":101.854},{"text":"words.","s":101.934,"e":102.654}]},{"template":"chat","chapter":"Why test first","narration":"Why does order matter? If the agent writes the code first, it tends to write tests that simply match whatever it wrote. And when it's stuck, it may quietly change the test instead of the code. Kent Beck once found an agent had replaced his logic with a lookup table of expected answers.","params":{"messages":[{"from":"agent","text":"The test expects 42 but we return 41. I'll update the test to expect 41.","tone":"bad","at":"change the test"},{"from":"you","text":"No. The expected value is the spec. Fix the code.","label":"hold the line","at":"instead of the code"},{"from":"agent","text":"Understood. Found it: rounding happens too early.","tone":"good","at":"lookup table"}]},"start":103.26,"dur":19.314,"words":[{"text":"Why","s":103.56,"e":103.88},{"text":"does","s":104,"e":104.12},{"text":"order","s":104.28,"e":104.52},{"text":"matter?","s":104.68,"e":105.08},{"text":"If","s":105.72,"e":105.88},{"text":"the","s":105.92,"e":105.96},{"text":"agent","s":106.04,"e":106.36},{"text":"writes","s":106.52,"e":106.68},{"text":"the","s":106.72,"e":106.76},{"text":"code","s":106.84,"e":107.08},{"text":"first,","s":107.24,"e":107.88},{"text":"it","s":107.96,"e":108.04},{"text":"tends","s":108.08,"e":108.36},{"text":"to","s":108.4,"e":108.44},{"text":"write","s":108.52,"e":108.68},{"text":"tests","s":108.76,"e":109.24},{"text":"that","s":109.32,"e":109.4},{"text":"simply","s":109.48,"e":109.88},{"text":"match","s":110.04,"e":110.2},{"text":"whatever","s":110.36,"e":110.52},{"text":"it","s":110.6,"e":110.68},{"text":"wrote.","s":110.72,"e":111.56},{"text":"And","s":111.6,"e":111.64},{"text":"when","s":11